# Buildable ground. Tiles both ways, drawn at 2x into a 44px cell.
#
# The whole grid question — can I build here? — is answered by hue: green is
# yours, brown is the road. That is why neither tile has a drawn border. A
# gridline over the top would be a third thing to read, and the player already
# has the answer from two feet away.
name towerdefense-turf
size 22 22
key M turf-1
key S turf-2
key H turf-3-hilite
pixels
